#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Rebind the registered visible OpenCode worker to the live port/pane.

This tool is intentionally narrow:
- scans only the current tmux session/window
- uses read-only process/socket inspection plus GET-only OpenCode probes
- never sends tmux input
- never starts/stops workers
- writes only framework rebind reports and, with --allow-rebind, the visible
  worker registry plus project-local prompt/AGENTS managed block.
"""

